<%- include('partials/assessment-head',{title:'Mental Health & Stress'}) %><section class="info-hero-card"><p class="result-label">Your wellbeing comes first</p><h1>Mental Health & Stress</h1><p>Two guided reflections for adults, each with 60 items: 30 direct questions and 30 everyday situations.</p><p>These custom questionnaires are not clinically validated. They describe your responses and do not diagnose conditions or assign clinical severity.</p></section><div class="assessment-grid"><% ['mental-health','stress'].forEach(key=>{const a=assessments[key]; %><section class="card"><p><%= key==='mental-health' ? 'Main wellbeing assessment' : 'Pressure and recovery' %></p><h2><%= a.title %></h2><p><%= a.sections.map(s=>s.title).join(' · ') %></p><p>Six sections · Current daily experience · Answer every item</p><a class="button" href="/assessments/<%= key %>">Start reflection</a></section><% }) %></div><%- include('partials/support') %><section class="card"><h2>Your saved reports</h2><p>Reports are visible through your account. Completed reports save automatically and appear on your dashboard. You can delete a report at any time.</p><% if(!reports.length){ %><p>No saved reports yet.</p><% } %><% reports.forEach(r=>{ %><article class="history-entry"><h3><%= r.title %></h3><p><%= new Date(r.createdAt).toLocaleString('en-IN',{timeZone:'Asia/Kolkata'}) %> IST · <%= r.answered %>/60 answered</p><a class="small-button" href="/assessments/result/<%= r.id %>">View report</a><form action="/assessments/result/<%= r.id %>/delete" method="POST"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrf %>"><button type="submit">Delete report</button></form></article><% }) %></section></main></div></body></html>